    <description>2026-09-10 fix: added AF_CustomerFacing__c/AF_IncludedInQuote__c defaults to every new draft line (previously both were left blank/false, so nothing added here ever reached a Create Quotation quote without a manual edit first). Internal Provider Item (Internal Requisition line type) defaults both flags to false since it&apos;s a cost the customer shouldn&apos;t see; every other category defaults both to true, matching how a rep expects &quot;add this to the deal&quot; to behave. Also excluded Trim/Line Variant (selected only via the dedicated vehicle-selection picker, same as Vehicle Model) and Trade-In Deduction (system-managed, only ever created automatically by the Create Quotation flow&apos;s trade-in logic) from the product picker. CHANGED 2026-09-10 (second pass, real user feedback): Internal Provider Item is no longer excluded from Get_Products - staff can now add an internal requisition line manually through this picker. Formula_DefaultCustomerFacing still forces AF_CustomerFacing__c/AF_IncludedInQuote__c to false for that category, so an internal cost line still never shows to the customer or reaches a quote even though it can now be added here. LFRDN-747 (2026-09-27): that 2026-09-10 change only touched Get_Products (the no-brand path) - Get_Products_For_Brand, used for every branded deal (i.e. almost every real Opportunity), still had its own separate Internal Provider Item exclusion left in place, so Dealer Prep &amp; Registration products could never actually be added on a branded deal. Removed that filter too, and added Formula_DefaultRequiresInternalRequisition so an Internal Provider Item line defaults AF_RequiresInternalRequisition__c = true instead of requiring a manual edit afterward. 2026-09-28: every line added here now defaults AF_RequiresInternalRequisition__c = true (not only Internal Provider Item), and Package products are excluded from both product pickers.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Formula_DefaultCustomerFacing</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>NOT(TEXT({!Loop_through_Entries.Product2.AF_ProductCategory__c}) = &quot;Internal Provider Item&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Formula_LineItemType</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
    ISBLANK(TEXT({!Loop_through_Entries.Product2.AF_ProductCategory__c})),
    &quot;Other&quot;,
    IF(
        TEXT({!Loop_through_Entries.Product2.AF_ProductCategory__c}) = &quot;Service Item&quot;,
        &quot;Provider Service&quot;,
        IF(
            TEXT({!Loop_through_Entries.Product2.AF_ProductCategory__c}) = &quot;Internal Provider Item&quot;,
            &quot;Internal Requisition&quot;,
            TEXT({!Loop_through_Entries.Product2.AF_ProductCategory__c})
        )
    )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
